    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολέπω</span></b> , aor. 2
		
			Pass.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπελέπην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			:—<i>peel, skin,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μάστιγι τὸ νῶτον</span> cj. Ruhnk.
			in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				237
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ᾠὸν τὸ λέμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					673
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θπίδακος ἀπολελεμμένας τὸν καυλόν</span>
			<i>with</i> the stalk <i>peeled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				158
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lop off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεῦτο ἀπολεψέμεν οὔατα χαλκῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.455
				</span></i>
			 (dub.l.).</div>
